><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a>:\n<ul><li>Bought from or given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/25px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/38px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/50px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helsik\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/25px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\">Helsik</a></li>\n<li>In an Opulent Chest upstairs in Helsik's room</li>\n<li>In a Big Pot in the basement at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;381&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;769</span></li></ul></li>\n<li>In a chest in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/38px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/50px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin's</a> room in the <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>One piece of Infernal Marble is needed for the ritual inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee#Upper_floor\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a> to open the portal to the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Infernal Marble in Orin's room is only obtainable, when playing as the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Urge\">Dark Urge</a>.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202937\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38908/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9089/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1089823/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.291      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   50.291      1 -total\n 53.60%   26.956      8 Template:Icon_text\n 48.94%   24.614     23 Template:Trim\n 27.78%   13.969      4 Template:Uid\n 13.33%    6.705      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.22%    6.647      2 Template:Hidden_code\n